{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117220","id":3370080257,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7I31gB","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117220","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117220.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117220.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117220","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117220/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117220/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117220/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/94e44424f06c318c2ce5dd79baa698f23cb75678","number":117220,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix new resource locked when created via editable children in inspector","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #112211\r\nFixes #120192\r\n\r\nCreating a new Resource via the inspector picker on a node that is an editable child of another scene, _get_owner_path() would return the owner node's scene file path (the external/child scene), causing the newly created resource to get a path like 'child.tscn::...' instead of 'parent.tscn::...'.\r\n\r\nThe resource would then appear as foreign to the currently edited scene, locking it as read-only in the inspector until the scene was saved and reopened.\r\n\r\nThe fix: after resolving the owner via get_owner(), check if that owner belongs to a different scene than the currently edited one. If so, use the edited scene root's path instead, consistent with the existing guard for nodes that have their own scene_file_path set.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1332303119,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzMyMzAzMTE5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/regression","name":"regression","description":"","color":"ff63ac","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":